OL,3,GNEWSABreak-in attempts at former
OL,4,Acouncil HQ prompt security dog patrols
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity measures have been increased
OL,7,Fat a former council headquarters after
OL,8,Fattempted break-ins.
OL,10,FDurham County Council said dog patrols
OL,11,Fand CCTV cameras had been brought in at
OL,12,FCounty Hall at Aykley Heads, which
OL,13,Fclosed in July after 63 years of use
OL,14,Fand is set to be demolished next year.
OL,16,FThe council said there had been a
OL,17,F"small number of occasions" when people
OL,18,Ftried to get into the building, but
OL,19,F"were challenged and asked to leave,
OL,20,Fand the police were notified where
OL,21,Fappropriate".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
