OL,3,GNEWSABreak-in attempts at former
OL,4,Acouncil HQ prompt security dog patrols
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition is due to begin in March and
OL,7,FKevin Lough, the council's interim head
OL,8,Fof corporate buildings, said the extra
OL,9,Fsecurity would remain in place until
OL,10,Fthat is finished.
